{"ts":"2026-06-05T14:47:46.415Z","author":"codex","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-beads-27rw"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"beads validate does not detect dependency cycles"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"validateBeadsText checked dangling refs, dup ids, unknown status, missing title — but never walked the edge graph, so a circular blocked-by chain (A→B→A) passed validation cleanly. Such a cycle is a deadlock the real bd tooling rejects and produces an unschedulable graph once imported into pm."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Feature"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":[]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-06-05T14:47:46.415Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-06-05T14:47:46.415Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"validate detects directed cycles in the in-file blocked-by graph (incl. self-deps) and reports them as dependency_cycle errors; only in-file ids considered (no false positives on cross-workspace/dangling edges); acyclic files unaffected; helper unit-tested + e2e verified"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"dfcaed6596bf9580e6e71550b78567107486f33049429a1b0026391df9dc629b","message":""}
